This project is an independent, unaffiliated extension for Kable
(https://github.com/JuulLabs/kable), a Kotlin Multiplatform Bluetooth Low Energy library by
JUUL Labs, Inc. Kable is used as a dependency, unmodified, and is itself licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. This project is not endorsed by or affiliated with JUUL Labs.

The architecture is inspired by ESPHome's Bluetooth Proxy
(https://esphome.io/components/bluetooth_proxy/), which established the pattern of relaying the
BLE/GATT surface over IP behind the host BLE library's own interface for Home Assistant. No
ESPHome or Home Assistant code is used; the inspiration is architectural. This project is not
endorsed by or affiliated with the ESPHome or Home Assistant projects.
